# Predictability Model of Behavior (PMB)

Located in `MetricsEngine` within `bridge_server.py`. Runs after every `analyze_and_update()` call. Four subsystems execute in sequence, each reloading fresh metrics before computing:

1. `_compute_crisis_perception()` — objective vs expressed distress
2. `_compute_shame_profile()` — shame index, core beliefs, masking
3. `_compute_pmb()` — reactivity, triggers, cycles, reconsolidation readiness
4. `_extract_legacy_patterns()` — family-of-origin pattern detection

## Data Structures (stored in `nevedal_state`)

| Key | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `crisis_perception` | dict | Distress discrepancy, minimization, sensitivity, normalization, baseline enum |
| `shame_profile` | dict | Shame index (0-1), baseline, core beliefs list, shame map, masking pattern enum |
| `pmb` | dict | Cyclical patterns, trigger map, reactivity indicators, reconsolidation readiness, predictions |
| `pmb.legacy_patterns` | list | Transgenerational entries with source, pattern, `reflected_in_client`, `cross_validated` |

## Crisis Perception Baselines

| Baseline | Meaning |
|---|---|
| CALIBRATED | Self-report matches objective distress |
| MINIMIZER | Understates distress (discrepancy < -0.15) |
| AMPLIFIER | Overstates distress (discrepancy > 0.15) |
| NORMALIZER | Treats elevated distress as normal |
| CALIBRATING | < 5 data points collected |

## Reconsolidation Readiness (0-1)

Weighted composite: `therapeutic_range * 0.30 + engagement * 0.25 + emotional_charge * 0.25 + trigger_present * 0.20`. Above 0.6 signals a reconsolidation window to the coach.

## Transgenerational Legacy — 8 Pattern Categories

`emotional_suppression`, `caretaker_role`, `rage_cycle`, `abandonment`, `perfectionism`, `addiction`, `enmeshment`, `neglect`

Detected via family-of-origin references (mom/dad/grandparent/growing up) co-occurring with pattern keywords. Cross-validated against client's own reactivity and crisis perception baseline (e.g., parent's `abandonment` reflected if client is `AMPLIFIER`).

## Minimum Data Requirements

| Feature | Min entries needed |
|---|---|
| Cyclical patterns | 28 mood history entries |
| Crisis precursors | 3 crisis events |
| Trigger mapping | 10 interactions |
| Reactivity classification | 30 interactions |
| Core beliefs | 8 shame indicator entries |
| Legacy patterns | 5 family references |

## Rules

- Never modify reconsolidation readiness weights without updating the patent document
- Legacy patterns are surfaced to coaches as "reflect with curiosity only" — never as confrontational prompts
- CEE mismatches increment `corrective_experience_count` on reflected legacy patterns — this tracks generational cycle-breaking
- PMB predictions require >= 0.5 confidence before surfacing to UI
- Max 20 legacy patterns stored per client (oldest pruned)
